sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User (via OpenWebUI)
    participant API as FastAPI /v1/chat/completions
    participant QA as Query Analyzer Agent
    participant RET as Retriever Agent
    participant KB as search_knowledge_base tool<br/>(LlamaIndex + PGVector)
    participant SYN as Synthesizer Agent
    participant VER as Verifier Agent
    participant PHX as Phoenix (tracing)

    U->>API: "What's our PTO accrual rate?"
    API->>QA: analyze(question, chat_history)
    QA-->>PHX: span: query_analysis
    QA->>API: standalone_query, sub_queries, answer_type

    loop up to CREW_MAX_ITERATIONS
        API->>RET: retrieve(sub_queries)
        RET->>KB: search_knowledge_base(query, top_k)
        KB-->>RET: passages + source_file + section_path + score
        RET-->>PHX: span: retrieval (+ tool call)
        RET->>SYN: evidence passages
        SYN-->>PHX: span: synthesis
        SYN->>VER: draft_answer
        VER->>VER: check claims vs evidence
        VER-->>PHX: span: verification

        alt approved
            VER->>API: APPROVE
        else rejected
            VER->>API: REJECT + refined_query
            Note over API,RET: refined_query becomes next<br/>iteration's search input
        end
    end

    API->>U: final answer + citations (+ "unverified" flag if never approved)
